    "text": "ncktoday.com\nwebsite\nConcordia\nConcordia USD 333 BOE to Meet Monday\n1 days ago\nThe Concordia USD 333 Board of Education will hold their regular monthly meeting on Monday, August 11 starting at 6 PM at the Administrative Offices in Concordia. Agenda items include setting the Revenue Neutral Rate and Budget Hearings for September 8 at 6 PM and 6:05 PM respectively, enrollment report, Board of Education goals for the 2025-26 school year, facility updates, reports from Superintendent, Operation Director, Curriculum Director, Foundation and LCNCK Director, and budget. Action items include LCNCK contract - bylaws and salary updates for classified and certified staff and administration and any new hires, transfers, resignations and terminations of certified and classified staff.",
